 "caption": "NQ. ES. YM. Three trades? No. ONE bet. 🎯\n\nA trader goes long Nasdaq, S&P and Dow futures, risking 1% on each. It feels diversified, but the three indices move together: when the market sells off, all three stops get hit in the same candle. That's a 3% loss on one idea, three times the risk the plan allowed.\n\n1️⃣ Check correlation before opening a second position\n2️⃣ Highly correlated trades share the same risk budget\n3️⃣ Split your 1% across them instead of stacking it\n\nFollow @institutionalmetatrading for daily order flow and risk rules.\n\nEducational content. Not financial advice.\n\n#riskmanagement #positionsizing #correlation #tradingpsychology #daytrading #futurestrading #nasdaq #sp500"
